OL,3,GNEWSA'Nightmare' to save as average    
OL,4,Asemi-detached house price hits 19-year 
OL,5,Ahigh                                   
OL,7,FThe average price of a semi-detached   
OL,8,Fhouse in Northern Ireland has exceeded 
OL,9,Fthe level last reached in 2007 before  
OL,10,Fthe property crash.                    
OL,12,FIn the third quarter of this year the  
OL,13,Faverage price was #209,953, compared to
OL,14,F#205,169 in the third quarter of 2007. 
OL,16,FThe effects of inflation means that    
OL,17,Fhouses are still substantially cheaper 
OL,18,Fin real terms today. For example,      
OL,19,Faverage full time wages in NI are now  
OL,20,Fabout 70% higher in cash terms compared
OL,21,Fto 2007.                               
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
