OL,4,Asemi-detached house price hits 19-year 
OL,5,Ahigh                                   
OL,7,FHowever the process for saving for a   
OL,8,Fhouse has been described as "a         
OL,9,Fnightmare" by some who wish to get onto
OL,10,Fthe property ladder.                   
